#. module: kaitech_mcp
msgid ""
"SQL bypasses Odoo access rights, record rules, Python constraints, computed fields and tracking.\n"
"                            When on, each key still needs Allow SQL and its tables ticked. Switching it off clears Allow SQL on every key."
msgstr ""
"SQL melewati hak akses Odoo, record rule, constraint Python, field compute, dan tracking.\n"
"                            Saat nyala, setiap kunci tetap butuh Izinkan SQL dan tabelnya dicentang. Mematikannya menghapus centang Izinkan SQL di semua kunci."

#. module: kaitech_mcp
msgid "SQL is switched off in MCP Settings, so Allow SQL cannot be ticked."
msgstr "SQL dimatikan di Pengaturan MCP, jadi Izinkan SQL tidak bisa dicentang."

#. module: kaitech_mcp
msgid ""
"SQL runs as the database itself: it bypasses Odoo access rights, record rules, Python constraints,\n"
"                                computed fields and chatter tracking. Tick only the tables this client truly needs. Updates and\n"
"                                deletes need a where condition and change at most 20 rows per call; every statement is in the call log."
msgstr ""
"SQL berjalan sebagai database itu sendiri: melewati hak akses Odoo, record rule, constraint Python,\n"
"                                field compute, dan tracking chatter. Centang hanya tabel yang benar-benar dibutuhkan klien ini. Update dan\n"
"                                delete wajib punya kondisi where dan mengubah paling banyak 20 baris per panggilan; setiap statement tercatat di log panggilan."

#. module: kaitech_mcp
msgid "SQL runs as the database itself: it bypasses Odoo access rights, record rules, Python constraints, computed fields and chatter tracking. Only the tables listed on the SQL tab can be used, only when SQL is also switched on in MCP Settings, and never when the key acts as an administrator."
msgstr "SQL berjalan sebagai database itu sendiri: melewati hak akses Odoo, record rule, constraint Python, field compute, dan tracking chatter. Hanya tabel di tab SQL yang bisa dipakai, hanya bila SQL juga dinyalakan di Pengaturan MCP, dan tidak pernah bila kunci bertindak sebagai administrator."

