msgid ""
"The client may call public business methods, for example Confirm on a sales "
"order, of the models ticked in the Call column. They run as the key's user "
"with its access rights and record rules, and change whatever the same button"
" changes in Odoo. Private methods and ORM methods such as write or unlink "
"are always refused."
msgstr ""
"Klien boleh memanggil metode bisnis publik, misalnya Confirm pada sales "
"order, dari model yang dicentang di kolom Panggil. Metode berjalan sebagai "
"user milik key ini dengan hak akses dan record rule-nya, dan mengubah apa "
"pun yang diubah tombol yang sama di Odoo. Metode privat dan metode ORM "
"seperti write atau unlink selalu ditolak."

#. module: kaitech_mcp
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:kaitech_mcp.field_kaitech_mcp_key__allow_explore
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:kaitech_mcp.field_kaitech_mcp_key_wizard__allow_explore
msgid ""
"The client may read how the installed modules are built: models, fields, "
"methods and their source code, views, actions, menus and other code files "
"inside the module folders. These tools never return records, settings values"
" or files outside the module folders."
msgstr ""
"Klien boleh membaca cara modul terpasang dibangun: model, field, metode "
"beserta kode sumbernya, view, action, menu, dan berkas kode lain di dalam "
"folder modul. Alat ini tidak pernah mengembalikan record, nilai pengaturan, "
"atau berkas di luar folder modul."

